# Working notes, not part of the site. Because `pages_build_output_dir = "."`,
# committing this would publish it at https://ani-3d.pages.dev/MEDIA-MIGRATION-PLAN.md
# — no secrets in it, but it names Drive folder ids and describes the infra.
/MEDIA-MIGRATION-PLAN.md

# The old generated Bhadoo/GoIndex worker, kept only as a local reference. It
# still holds a live OAuth client_secret + refresh_token as plaintext constants,
# and `pages_build_output_dir = "."` means ANY committed file is served publicly
# (https://ani-3d.pages.dev/<path>). Committing it would hand out read access to
# the Drive account. Its replacement, files-worker/, is committed — that one
# reads its credentials from Worker secrets and hardcodes nothing.
/worker.js
